# The NT and LM password hashes (MS-NLMP 3.3.1, NTOWFv1 and LMOWFv1).
# Do not edit.
#
# lm rows: password = the bytes hashed, in the OEM code page, before
# uppercasing ("-" is empty). Each row was produced by Samba 4.9's
# libcli/auth/smbdes.c (its own DES, str_to_key and E_P16, with ASCII
# uppercasing and zero padding to fourteen bytes as E_deshash does) and by
# impacket's compute_lmhash over OpenSSL's DES, and kept only where both
# agree.
# nt rows: password = the text as UTF-8; the hash is OpenSSL's MD4 (legacy
# provider) of it as UTF-16 little endian.

